    story: "Quilox Ambermere grew up in the shadow of a dead Ark on the Grey Reach.\n\nThe Moonsedge Pack keeps a ledger of every vault field and every sighting its members have ever heard of. With Quilox aboard, that ledger is open to your crew: vaults to open, and lairs to hunt.\n\nThey cannot resist a dare."
