    story: "Pediri Wakereach grew up on a salvage barge on Tangleweed.\n\nThe house holds cores across the sea for the domains it answers to. With Pediri in your crew, Albrine will send you to patrol them, to answer its calls for aid, and to take back a core another domain has seized.\n\nThey keep score of everything, including naps."
