    family: "Coralrest"
    speciesOne: 5
    speciesTwo: 45
    factionType: 5
    factionName: "Writ and Hook"
    homeworld: "the Grey Reach"
    story: "Brilolia Coralrest grew up on a salvage barge on the Grey Reach.\n\nWrit and Hook takes the bounties others will not. With Brilolia aboard, your crew will be handed warrants on notorious crews, and told where to meet them.\n\nThey talk to the Ark at night and insist it answers."
  - key: Ithax
    callsign: 18
    starter: 1
    given: "Ithax"
    family: "Moonmark"
    speciesOne: 27
    speciesTwo: 13
    factionType: 8
    factionName: "The Pickled Hand"
    homeworld: "Coldharbour"
    story: "Ithax Moonmark grew up on a salvage barge on Coldharbour.\n\nThe The Pickled Hand moves news between ports before anyone knows it has moved. With Ithax aboard, your crew will be sent to lift dispatches from rival ports, and to be gone before morning.\n\nThey have never once arrived early."
  - key: Makoola
    callsign: 1
