    homeworld: "Brackenmouth"
    story: "Makoola Starsail learned to fly before they could read on Brackenmouth.\n\nThe Deepreed Stalkers follow sightings across the HyperSea. Fly with Makoola and you will hear of vault fields before other crews do, and of lairs where something has grown too large to leave alone.\n\nThey talk to the Ark at night and insist it answers."
