    homeworld: "Rimehollow"
    story: "Talolo Foamrest grew up on a salvage barge on Rimehollow.\n\nThe Velvet Gill trades in news before it is news. With Talolo aboard, your crew will be sent to lift dispatches from rival ports and carry them away first.\n\nThey keep score of everything, including naps."
  - key: Iri
    callsign: 3
    starter: 1
    given: "Iri"
    family: "Whistlebell"
    speciesOne: 33
    speciesTwo: 35
    factionType: 11
    factionName: "Spray and Spin"
    homeworld: "Wrackline"
    story: "Iri Whistlebell was raised by a choir of dockworkers on Wrackline.\n\nThe Spray and Spin runs exhibition courses all over the HyperSea. With Iri aboard, your crew will be invited to fly them: skim the course, gather the crystals, and make the crowd stand up.\n\nThey laugh at exactly the wrong moments."
