    homeworld: "Lowlight"
    story: "Miben Glasscove was apprenticed to a cartographer on Lowlight.\n\nSlipstream Racing Club put on exhibition runs in the brightest cells of the HyperSea. With Miben aboard, your crew will be invited to fly them, skimming the course for every crystal on it.\n\nThey collect shells from every port and give them away to strangers."
  - key: Verao
    callsign: 5
