    factionType: 1
    factionName: "Amber Ledger Guild"
    homeworld: "the Old Harbour"
    story: "Verao Emberrest spent a childhood stowing away on freighters on the Old Harbour.\n\nThe Amber Ledger Guild keeps accounts in every port. With Verao aboard, your crew will carry the Guild's dispatches, and run its convoys to ports under pressure.\n\nThey have never once arrived early."
