    factionName: "Copperclaim Agency"
    homeworld: "the Silver Lane"
    story: "Pewen Reefwatch learned to fly before they could read on the Silver Lane.\n\nCopperclaim Agency carries the warrants on the most notorious crews in the HyperSea. With Pewen aboard, your crew will be handed bounties, and told where the crew was last seen standing.\n\nThey refuse to fly on an empty stomach."
  - key: Briraix
    callsign: 8
