    speciesOne: 12
    speciesTwo: 32
    factionType: 2
    factionName: "Moonsedge Pack"
    homeworld: "the Glass Shoals"
    story: "Briraix Driftthorn was raised among reef gardeners on the Glass Shoals.\n\nThe Moonsedge Pack trades in rumours: a vault field glimpsed through the mist, a lair where the predators have grown too bold. Fly with Briraix and those rumours become your crew's work.\n\nThey name every vessel they fly, and apologise to it after a hard landing."
  - key: Mata
    callsign: 9
