    family: "Kelpfin"
    speciesOne: 34
    speciesTwo: 23
    factionType: 3
    factionName: "Court of Still Water"
    homeworld: "Driftmoor"
    story: "Ludira Kelpfin grew up sorting crystals in a market stall on Driftmoor.\n\nCourt of Still Water binds a dozen harbours to keep each other's cores. With Ludira in your crew, the Accord will send you to patrol them, to answer a harbour's call for aid, and to take a core back when another domain holds it.\n\nThey talk to the Ark at night and insist it answers."
  - key: Belsiar
    callsign: 11
    starter: 1
    given: "Belsiar"
    family: "Silvermore"
    speciesOne: 44
    speciesTwo: 40
    factionType: 7
    factionName: "Open Current"
    homeworld: "Starwake"
    story: "Belsiar Silvermore was raised by a choir of dockworkers on Starwake.\n\nThe Open Current tears down the pens other domains build around the HyperSea's creatures. With Belsiar aboard, your crew will be told where those pens are, and asked to break them open.\n\nThey have never once arrived early."
  - key: Canuar
    callsign: 12
    starter: 1
    given: "Canuar"
    family: "Stormwatch"
    speciesOne: 23
    speciesTwo: 14
    factionType: 2
    factionName: "Hollowfen Trackers"
    homeworld: "the Glass Shoals"
    story: "Canuar Stormwatch grew up the youngest of eleven on the Glass Shoals.\n\nHollowfen Trackers follows rumours of old vaults and the lairs where predators gather. With Canuar aboard, your crew will be sent to empty those vaults, and to hunt the lairs when they swell.\n\nThey keep a jar of every crystal they have ever missed."
