    story: "Emao Ambermark grew up sorting crystals in a market stall on the Kelp Throne.\n\nThe Choir of the Deep keeps vigil at shrines across the HyperSea. With Emao aboard, your crew will be asked to hold a shrine through its vigil, and the Choir has older rites it shares only with crews it trusts.\n\nThey name every vessel they fly, and apologise to it after a hard landing."
