    homeworld: "Ember Deep"
    story: "Oth Farmere learned to fly before they could read on Ember Deep.\n\nThe Reefward Trust look after the nurseries where the HyperSea's young things grow. With Oth aboard, your crew will be asked to tend a nursery and keep it safe, with no killing while you are there.\n\nThey refuse to fly on an empty stomach."
